  m_text: '

    HOW TO PLAY



    Explore the forest and collect 5 magical crystals.



    CONTROLS:

    W
    - Move forward

    S - Move backward

    A - Move left

    D - Move right

    Mouse
    - Look around

    ESC - Pause the game



    OBJECTIVE:

    Collect all 5
    crystals.

    Find the magical portal.

    Enter the portal to win!



    Good
    luck, adventurer!'
